        "text_jQ7djM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you buy from Oceans Optics, you are not just getting a cool ocean Tee, you are helping us build real living coral reefs.</p><p>A portion of every sale goes toward our artificial reef project in Koh Tao, Thailand. We worked with Global Reef and the Thai Department of Marine & Coastal Resources to sink a custom steel structure shaped like a prescription scuba mask. Onto this frame we attach living coral fragments that grow over time, attracting fish and turning the structure into a living reef and safe haven for marine life.</p><p>So each time you wear your shirt, you are also actively giving back to the ocean we all love.</p>",
